---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { gym, telHref } from '../data/gym';

// NOTE FOR THE BUSINESS: this is a working draft written to match what the site
// actually does (see functions/api/booking.ts). It has not been reviewed by a lawyer.
// Before launch, confirm the items marked "TO CONFIRM" and have it checked by someone
// qualified. The Australian Privacy Principles (APP 5) require notifying people what
// you collect and why at the point of collection.
const lastUpdated = 'July 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How XFC Carrum Downs collects, uses and protects your personal information."
>
  <section class="bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] py-20 md:py-24 px-4 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="font-inter text-[var(--accent-primary)] text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-medium mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-bebas text-white text-4xl md:text-6xl uppercase tracking-wide mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="font-inter text-[var(--text-muted)] text-sm">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[var(--bg-primary)] py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto policy">
      <p>
        {gym.name} ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal
        information we collect through this website, why we collect it, how we store it and
        who we share it with. It is written to align with the Australian Privacy Principles
        under the <em>Privacy Act 1988</em> (Cth).
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit an enquiry or trial booking form on this website, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Your name</strong> and <strong>email address</strong> — required, so we can identify and contact you.</li>
        <li><strong>Your phone number</strong> — optional.</li>
        <li><strong>Your class interest and preferred day</strong> — optional, so we can place you in a suitable class.</li>
        <li><strong>Anything you write in the message field</strong> — optional. This field invites you to tell us about previous experience, injuries or the age of a child. Please only include what you are comfortable sharing; you are not required to disclose health information to book a trial.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not collect payment details through this website, and we do not ask for
        government identifiers.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's information</h2>
      <p>
        Our junior programs are for children. If you are enquiring on behalf of a child, we
        ask that a parent or guardian submits the form and provides only the details needed
        to place the child in the right class. We rely on the parent or guardian's consent
        for that information. If you would like a child's details removed, contact us and we
        will delete them.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiry and organise your trial session.</li>
        <li>To answer questions you have asked us.</li>
        <li>To keep a record of enquiries so we can follow up appropriately.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We will not use your details for marketing unless you have separately agreed to
        that. You can ask us to stop contacting you at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>How it is stored and who can see it</h2>
      <p>
        The forms on this website are provided by our customer-management platform
        (served from <em>links.xfcgymcarrumdowns.com</em>). When you submit a form, your
        details go directly into that platform, where our team manages and responds to
        enquiries. Access is limited to staff who need it to respond to you. This website
        is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. These providers process your information on our
        behalf and may store it outside Australia.
      </p>
      <p class="policy-note">
        TO CONFIRM before launch: state how long enquiry records are kept in the CRM, and
        whether the platform sends SMS/email follow-ups automatically (if so, that should
        be disclosed here too).
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not use cookies for advertising. If website analytics are enabled, we
        use them only to understand aggregate traffic patterns — such as which pages are
        visited — with IP addresses anonymised. Analytics do not identify you personally and
        are not linked to your booking enquiry.
      </p>

      <h2>Embedded content</h2>
      <p>
        Our enquiry forms are embedded from our customer-management platform
        (<em>links.xfcgymcarrumdowns.com</em>), which may set its own functional cookies
        inside the form. The Facilities page embeds a Google Map so you can find us —
        loading it means Google may receive your IP address and set its own cookies,
        governed by Google's privacy policy rather than this one. Links to our Instagram,
        Facebook and YouTube pages take you to those platforms, which have their own
        policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Accessing or correcting your information</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or
        ask us to delete it. Email <a href={`mailto:${gym.email}`}>{gym.email}</a> or call
        <a href={telHref}>{gym.phone}</a> and we will respond within a reasonable time. There
        is no charge for making a request.
      </p>

      <h2>Complaints</h2>
      <p>
        If you think we have mishandled your personal information, contact us first and we
        will investigate. If you are not satisfied with our response, you can complain to
        the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner at
        <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener">oaic.gov.au</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it was
        last changed.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        {gym.name}<br />
        {gym.street}, {gym.suburb} {gym.state} {gym.postcode}<br />
        <a href={`mailto:${gym.email}`}>{gym.email}</a><br />
        <a href={telHref}>{gym.phone}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .policy { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.75; }
    .policy h2 {
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    }
    .policy p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .policy ul { margin: 0 0 1rem 1.25rem; list-style: disc; }
    .policy li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .policy strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 500; }
    .policy a { color: var(--accent-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
    .policy a:hover { color: #c9a538; }
    .policy-note {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-primary);
      background: rgb(var(--accent-primary-rgb) / 0.06);
      padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
